=1792481212\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3166140/extras/a798f08c351964b58d9190f56bfe2da0.mp4?t=1792481212\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Fast, skill-based combat.</strong> Move, aim, dodge and strike through hordes of the infected.<br></li><li><strong>Your weapons, your style.</strong> Swords, guns and supernatural powers you unlock as you grow stronger.<br></li><li><strong>Use the world.</strong> Recoil, timing and environmental damage turn every fight into a puzzle.</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3166140/extras/0de2f4954e66c9ee3dc55da30634e634.avif?t=1792481212\" width=1232 height=176 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3166140/extras/2282d5842fdd49d13fcb9b270ac57db1.poster.avif?t=1792481212\" width=1170 height=490 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3166140/extras/2282d5842fdd49d13fcb9b270ac57db1.webm?t=1792481212\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3166140/extras/2282d5842fdd49d13fcb9b270ac57db1.mp4?t=1792481212\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>After a devastating defeat, a mysterious hero carries Lean into a parallel realm. Four deadly stages hold the Gate Tokens he needs to return home.<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Sun-scorched forests, frozen peaks, haunted portals and burning castles.<br></li><li>Side missions, secrets and hidden paths in every stage.<br></li><li>Upgrades and abilities that shape the way Lean fights.</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3166140/extras/01e3b3